{
  "info": {
    "name": "S3 - Authentication & Login (OAuth2)",
    "description": "Skenario 3: User login dan mendapatkan JWT token\n\nFlow:\n1. POST /oauth/token dengan credentials\n2. Dapatkan access_token + refresh_token\n3. Gunakan access_token untuk protected endpoints\n4. Decode JWT untuk verifikasi role\n\nUsers tersedia:\n- farmer@agri.com / farmer123 (role: petani)\n- officer@agri.com / officer123 (role: petugas)\n- Gunakan token untuk akses private endpoints",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "3.1 Login as Petani",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
              "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.environment.set('token_petani', jsonData.access_token);",
              "    console.log('Token Petani set:', jsonData.access_token.substring(0, 50) + '...');",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "urlencoded",
          "urlencoded": [
            {
              "key": "grant_type",
              "value": "password"
            },
            {
              "key": "username",
              "value": "farmer@agri.com"
            },
            {
              "key": "password",
              "value": "farmer123"
            },
            {
              "key": "client_id",
              "value": "web-client"
            },
            {
              "key": "client_secret",
              "value": "web_client_secret_google"
            }
          ]
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{oauth_url}}/oauth/token",
          "host": ["{{oauth_url}}"],
          "path": ["oauth", "token"]
        },
        "description": "Login sebagai Petani (farmer@agri.com)\n\nResponse:\n- access_token: JWT token untuk request protected endpoints\n- refresh_token: Token untuk refresh access_token\n- expires_in: 3600 detik (1 jam)\n- token_type: Bearer\n\nToken akan otomatis disimpan ke environment variable 'token_petani'"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "3.2 Login as Petugas (Officer)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
              "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.environment.set('token_petugas', jsonData.access_token);",
              "    console.log('Token Petugas set:', jsonData.access_token.substring(0, 50) + '...');",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "urlencoded",
          "urlencoded": [
            {
              "key": "grant_type",
              "value": "password"
            },
            {
              "key": "username",
              "value": "officer@agri.com"
            },
            {
              "key": "password",
              "value": "farmer123"
            },
            {
              "key": "client_id",
              "value": "web-client"
            },
            {
              "key": "client_secret",
              "value": "web_client_secret_google"
            }
          ]
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{oauth_url}}/oauth/token",
          "host": ["{{oauth_url}}"],
          "path": ["oauth", "token"]
        },
        "description": "Login sebagai Petugas (officer@agri.com) - role: petugas\n\nPetugas memiliki akses lebih dari petani, misalnya bisa resolve alerts"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "3.3 Introspect Token (Verify Token Valid)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"{{token_petani}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{oauth_url}}/oauth/introspect",
          "host": ["{{oauth_url}}"],
          "path": ["oauth", "introspect"]
        },
        "description": "Verifikasi token masih valid. Response akan menunjukkan:\n- active: true/false\n- scope: token permissions\n- client_id: aplikasi yang issue token\n- username: user yang login\n- exp: token expiration time\n- iat: token issued at time"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "3.4 Decode JWT Payload (Manual)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{token_petani}}",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/farmers/{{farmer_id}}",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "farmers", "{{farmer_id}}"]
        },
        "description": "Gunakan token di header Authorization. Gateway akan decode JWT dan extract:\n- sub: user ID\n- role: user role (petani/petugas/admin)\n- client_id: aplikasi\n- iat: issued at\n- exp: expiration\n\nRole-based access control (RBAC) akan dijalankan berdasarkan role ini"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "3.5 Revoke Token (Logout)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"{{token_petani}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{oauth_url}}/oauth/revoke",
          "host": ["{{oauth_url}}"],
          "path": ["oauth", "revoke"]
        },
        "description": "Revoke (logout) token. Token tidak lagi bisa digunakan untuk request protected endpoints"
      },
      "response": []
    }
  ],
  "variable": []
}
